                <pb facs="0114" n="64" sameAs="frus:frus1894/pg64"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 2 in No.
                    227.—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Minister of Exterior to Mr.
                            Thompson.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Rio de Janeiro</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1894-04-24"><hi rendition="#italic">April 24,
                        1894</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Orders have been given in deference to the last solicitations of your excellency
                    relative to the telegraph. Good wishes to your excellency.</p>
                <closer><hi rendition="#small-caps">Minister of Exterior.</hi></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
